ess, and its equally unexpected failure.\" \"The third strain is literary...Each episode in the Bolshevik Family Saga, and each stage in the history of the Bolshevik prophecy is accompanied by a discussion of the literary works that sought to interpret and mythologize them.\"","matchedBy":"infobox_book:high","confidence":"high","attribution":{"label":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_House_of_Government","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"},"infobox":{"title":"The House of Government:A Saga of the Russian Revolution","author":"Yuri Slezkine","publisher":"Princeton University Press","publicationDate":"2017","publicationPlace":"United States","pages":"xv, 1104 p. (2018 Princeton 1st edition)","isbn":"9780691176949","language":"English","subject":"History of the Russian Revolution"},"publisherEvidenceId":"publisher-evidence-wikipedia-the-house-of-government-a-saga-of-the-russian-revolution-yuri-slezkine"},"sources":[{"id":"source-award-record-aha-george-l-mosse-aha-george-l-mosse-prize-official-page","label":"AHA George L. Mosse Prize official page","url":"https://www.historians.org/award-grant/george-l-mosse-prize/","accessedAt":"2026-08-20T21:35:58.016Z","confidence":"official","field":"award","note":"Official awards URL: https://www.historians.org/award-grant/george-l-mosse-prize/"},{"id":"source-award-record-laura-shannon-european-studies-laura-shannon-prize-2019-official-shortlist","label":"Laura Shannon Prize 2019 official shortlist","url":"https://nanovic.nd.edu/news/laura-shannon-prize-announces-2019-shortlist/","accessedAt":"2026-08-20T21:35:58.016Z","confidence":"official","field":"award"},{"id":"source-award-record-prose-world-history-prose-awards-2018-winners-archive","label":"PROSE Awards 2018 winners archive","url":"https://proseawards.com/winners/2018-award-winners/","accessedAt":"2026-08-20T21:35:58.016Z","confidence":"official","field":"award","note":"Official awards URL: https://prosea